#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&bomber; is a single player arcade game. The player is invading various "
"cities in a plane that is decreasing in height."
msgstr ""
"&bomber; je arkadna igra za jednog igrača. Igrač vrši invazije na razne "
"gradove u avionu koji smanjuje visinu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The goal of the game is to destroy all the buildings and advance to the next "
"level. Each level gets a harder by increasing the speed of the plane and the "
"height of the buildings."
msgstr ""
"Cilj igre je uništavanje svih zgrada i prelazak na sljedeći nivo. Svaki "
"levela je sve teži sa povečavanjem brzine aviona i visionom zgrada."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "How To Play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The player is flying a plane in a city. The plane flies from left to right. "
"Every time it disappears off the side of the play area, it reappears on the "
"left side again, but lower than it was before."
msgstr ""
"Igrač leti avionom iznad grada. Avion leti s lijeve na desnu stranu. Svaki "
"put kad nestane iz igračke arene, pojavi se na lijevoj strani ponovo,ali "
"niže nego što je bio prije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The player has to destroy all the buildings to clear the level. If the plane "
"crashes into a building, then the player loses a life and the plane is moved "
"to the top left of the play area again."
msgstr ""
"Igrač treba da uništi sve zgrade da pređe nivo. Ako avion udari u zgradu, "
"onda igrač gubi život i avion je pomjeren na lijevu stranu da krene iz "
"početka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Buildings are destroyed by dropping bombs on them. This can be done by "
"clicking the &LMB; or pressing the <quote>Space</quote> key. The bomb will "
"fall from the plane and hit anything directly below it."
msgstr ""
"Zgrade se uništavaju bacanjem bombi na njih. Ovo će se uraditi klikanjem na "
"&LMB; ili pritiskanjem <quote>Space</quote> tipke.Bomba će pasti iz aviona i "
"udariti u sve što je pravo ispod."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After clearing a level, the player advances to the next level. Each level "
"gets slightly harder than the previous level as the buildings get taller and "
"the plane gets faster."
msgstr ""
"Nakon završetka nivoa, igrač prelazi na slijedeći nivo. Svaki nivo je teži "
"od prethodnog jer zgrade postaju više a avion se brže kreće."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija Igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &bomber; configuration dialog allows you to select visual themes for "
"&bomber;."
msgstr ""
"&bomber; konfiguracijski dijalog dozvoljava vam da izaberete vizualnu temu "
"za &bomber;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a new theme simply choose the theme from the selection list. Each "
"item in the list shows a small preview left to the theme name. A selection "
"is immediately applied."
msgstr ""
"Da biste selektovali novu temu jednostavno izaberite temu sa selektovane "
"liste. Svaka stavka na listi pokazuje krati previd lijevo od imena teme. "
"Selekcija je automatski postavljena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you are satisfied with the theme you have selected you can click the "
"<guibutton>Close</guibutton> button, located at the bottom part of this "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Jednom kad ste zadovoljni sa temom trebate kliknuti na <guibutton>Zatvori</"
"guibutton> dugme, locirano na dnu dijaloga."

